5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about how easily our plans break when weather or roads change unexpectedly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"We always debate the novelty, but ignore the archives of what actually failed before.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Before we pick a service, we must verify if the staff actually possess the required skills.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"The initial budget looks fine, but I suspect the recurring costs will crush us later.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am concerned that new schedules might make it harder for people to reach us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, do you think looking at past failures will help us avoid repeating them?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, absolutely. If we don't read the post-mortems, we are just guessing in the dark.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, financial stability is key, but a budget without the right people is just a liability.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, agreed. I need to see how the funding is structured, not just the total amount.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should check where the buildings are relative to the people who need them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I want to see how the roads behave in winter, especially north of the river.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will pull the records from the two programmes we started six years ago.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I need to check the volunteer register and the supervision training logs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment details.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the bus links in the two outer wards.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,It feels safer to know the ground conditions before we promise to show up.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"History is the only honest witness in this room, so I will let it speak.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"If the skills aren't there, the service is a fantasy. I will check the roster.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I need to know if the money is a gift or a trap with strings attached.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"If the bus doesn't run, the library door is closed for half the neighborhood.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
