35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The roads closed eleven days, but the community halls kept their evening timetables running without interruption.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The digitisation batch from six years ago is still unindexed, yet the evening groups remain self-sustaining.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The volunteers run the repair clinic, but no staff member is trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The grant covers contracted session fees for twelve months, then the flat operating budget carries them.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The bus link in the outer wards was cut, so residents now face an hour's round trip.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, if the evening groups are self-sustaining, maybe we should lean on that instead of new staff.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, exactly. The records show the staff-heavy model bled resources, while the community-led one held.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, if the grant ends, we are stuck with a service we cannot supervise.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the equipment line was under budget, but the running costs overran by a third.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried that the new schedule will make it even harder for people in the outer wards to reach us.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"The delivery windows are risky, but the community halls seem to have their own reliable evening infrastructure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The data is clear: the staff-heavy model failed, but the community-led evening groups succeeded.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"The volunteers are ready, but the supervision gap is a serious risk we cannot ignore.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The funding shape is the problem. The grant is a one-year bridge, not a permanent foundation.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"If we rely on the community halls, we might actually reach the people the bus cut off.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I feel much better knowing the community halls can keep their timetables even when the roads close.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The archives confirm that the community-led model is the only one that has survived the test of time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I am confident the volunteers can handle the work, but we need a clear supervision plan.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am convinced that the community-led model is the only one that fits our long-term funding shape.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am relieved that the community halls can keep their evening timetables, even when the roads close.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
